  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Dialogue on new types of cooperation and agreements on the return and restitution of cultural property to Africa &#x2013; a continental approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity is in line with Priority Africa flagship program and contributes to the objective set by Agenda 2063 of the Africa Union with regard to the repatriation of all African cultural heritage and strengthen the implementation of the 1970 Convention on the Means of Prohibiting and Preventing the Illicit Import, Export and Transfer of Ownership of Cultural Property, and the work of the Intergovernmental Committee for Promoting the Return of Cultural Property to its Countries of Origin or its Restitution in case of Illicit Appropriation (ICPRCP). The role of museums and collections for development, peace, and social inclusion will be promoted in line with the 2015 Recommendation on Museums and Collections.</narrative>
  </description>
